# FENNEC FOUNTAIN: the hub's gates open at 5, 10, 20, 30 and 40 drops.
game fennec
wait 30
press A
wait 20
press A
wait 5
expect state == 1
cheat hub 6 13
hold UP 10
expect hub_y == 13
expect gates_open == 0
cheat drops 5
expect gates_open == 1
hold UP 20
expect hub_y < 13
cheat drops 40
expect gates_open == 5
